     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"de\" lang=\"de\"><hr/><p><b>German</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CapabilityStatement mii-cps-onko-capabilitystatement</b></p><a name=\"mii-cps-onko-capabilitystatement\"> </a><a name=\"hcmii-cps-onko-capabilitystatement\"> </a><h2 id=\"title\">MII CPS Onkology CapabilityStatement</h2><ul><li>Implementation Guide Version: 2026.0.3 </li><li>FHIR Version: 4.0.1 </li><li>Supported Formats: <code>xml</code>, <code>json</code></li><li>Published on: 2025-12-04 </li><li>Published by: Medizininformatik Initiative </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Note to Implementers: FHIR Capabilities</strong></p><p>Any FHIR capability may be 'allowed' by the system unless explicitly marked as 'SHALL NOT'. A few items are marked as MAY in the Implementation Guide to highlight their potential relevance to the use case.</p></blockquote><h2 id=\"rest\">FHIR RESTful Capabilities</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"/></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Capabilities by Resource/Profile</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Summary</h4><p>The summary table lists the resources that are part of this configuration, and for each resource it lists:</p><ul><li>The relevant profiles (if any)</li><li>The interactions supported by each resource (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>ype are only present if at least one of the resources has support for them.</li><li><span>The required, recommended, and some optional search parameters (if any). </span></li><li>The linked resources enabled for <code>_include</code></li><li>The other resources enabled for <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>The operations on the resource (if any)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource Type</b></th><th><b>Profile</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET a resource (read interaction)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET all set of resources of the type (search interaction)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT a new resource version (update interaction)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST a new resource (create interaction)\">C</b></th><th><b title=\"Required and recommended search parameters\">Searches</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#Condition1-1\">Condition</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/condition.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Condition</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-diagnose-primaertumor.html\">MII PR Onkologie Diagnose Primärtumor</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-fruehere-tumorerkrankung.html\">MII PR Onkologie Frühere Tumorerkrankung</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_id, _lastUpdated, _profile, verificationStatus, morphology-behavior-icdo3, code, body-site, subject, encounter, recorded-date, asserted-date, evidence-detail</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Specimen1-2\">Specimen</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/specimen.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Specimen</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-specimen.html\">MII PR Onkologie Specimen</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-krk-specimen.html\">MII PR Onkologie Specimen</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_id, _lastUpdated, _profile, accession, collected, subject</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#DiagnosticReport1-3\">DiagnosticReport</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/DiagnosticReport</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-befund.html\">MII PR Onkologie Befund</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_id, _lastUpdated, _profile, based-on, code, subject, encounter, specimen, conclusion</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Observation1-4\">Observation</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Observation</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-anzahl-befallene-lymphknoten.html\">MII PR Onkologie Anzahl der befallenen Lymphknoten</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-anzahl-untersuchte-lymphknoten.html\">MII PR Onkologie Anzahl der untersuchten Lymphknoten</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-anzahl-untersuchte-sentinel-lymphknoten.html\">MII PR Onkologie Anzahl der untersuchten Sentinel-Lymphknoten</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-onko-anzahl-befallene-sentinel-lymphknoten.html\">MII PR Onkologie Anzahl der befallenen Sentinel-Lymphknoten</a><br/